  "description": "Pure standalone release-gate policy. It consumes only labeled classifier outcomes and a versioned gate policy, computes positive-case coverage and false-negative rate, and returns an approval or rejection decision. It does not inspect raw inputs, sanitize exports, access storage, or know any application workflow.",
  "emits": [],
  "event_trigger": null,
  "evidence": [],
  "execution": {
